"World Ceremonial sounds, from Gentle Bell and Bright Chime to Ceremonial Drum and Trumpet Salute." = "“World Ceremonial”-geluiden, van “Gentle Bell” en “Bright Chime” tot “Ceremonial Drum” en “Trumpet Salute”.";
"World Ceremonial — World Ceremonial sounds, from Gentle Bell and Bright Chime to Ceremonial Drum and Trumpet Salute." = "World Ceremonial — “World Ceremonial”-geluiden, van “Gentle Bell” en “Bright Chime” tot “Ceremonial Drum” en “Trumpet Salute”.";
